PROBLEMS WITH DATA IN COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Keeping large static datasets directly inside App.jsx can create several
issues:

• Hard to Maintain
  - Data is mixed with component logic

• Difficult to Scale
  - Adding more data makes the component larger

• Hard to Reuse
  - Data becomes closely associated with one component/module

• Testing Challenges
  - Replacing data for different scenarios is less convenient

• Collaboration Issues
  - Multiple developers may need to edit the same file

• Large Components
  - Large embedded datasets make files harder to read

• Difficult to Update
  - Data changes require editing the component file

• Poor Separation of Concerns
  - Presentation and static data are mixed together


