UNDERSTANDING DATA FILE STRUCTURE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

A static data file should:

• Export Data
  - Make data available to other modules

• Use Clear Naming
  - Data variable names should be descriptive

• Organize Logically
  - Related records should be grouped together

• Include Necessary Fields
  - Include information required by consuming components

• Use Consistent Formatting
  - Maintain proper indentation and structure

• Include Comments Where Useful
  - Explain complex structures

• Avoid Unnecessary Duplication
  - Reusable values can be extracted when appropriate

• Validate Data
  - Ensure expected fields and values are present


