]


WHY IT MATTERS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Performance
  - Avoid unnecessary payload/data size

• Clarity
  - Consumers see relevant information

• Security
  - Sensitive/internal information should not be exposed to client code

• Maintainability
  - Smaller structures are easier to understand


